    "heading": "Level 14: Restoring Touch",
    "lineStart": 3488,
    "lineEnd": 3490
  },
  "section": "3.182",
  "rulesText": "When you use Lay On Hands on a creature, you can also remove one or more of the following conditions from the creature: Blinded, Charmed, Deafened, Frightened, Paralyzed, or Stunned. You must expend 5 Hit Points from the healing pool of Lay On Hands for each of these conditions you remove; those points don't also restore Hit Points to the creature."
}
